----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Exercise 13 - Identifying Locations with the Highest Average Salaries

Business Problem:
The finance team wants to identify which locations offer the highest average 
annual salaries for Data Analyst positions. This analysis will help evaluate where hiring budgets are the highest.
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SELECT 
    job_title_short, 
    job_location, 
    ROUND(AVG(salary_year_avg), 2) AS avg_salary,
    ROUND(
        (AVG(salary_year_avg) / SUM(AVG(salary_year_avg)) OVER()) * 100, 
        2
    ) AS pct_of_total
FROM job_postings_fact
WHERE salary_year_avg IS NOT NULL 
  AND job_title_short = 'Data Analyst'
GROUP BY 
    job_title_short, 
    job_location
ORDER BY 
    avg_salary DESC;

-- Business Insight:
-- Santa Barbara, CA offers the highest average annual salary among Data Analyst job postings.
